<title>INDIA: India net FII inflows at $57.7 mln during July 1-9.</title>
<headline>India net FII inflows at $57.7 mln during July 1-9.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net inflows from foreign institutional investors (FIIs) into Indian stock markets totalled $57.7 million during the period from July 1 to July 9, the market regulator said on Friday.</p>
</text>
